{"unit_id":"my-dsh__dsh-web-search-tavily#card-zh","repo":"my-dsh/dsh-web-search-tavily","commit":"4b4ea31a7012c6b51f9ba7c4a9d08c9bc2d1f53f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-tavily 是为 DSH Web 能力接入 Tavily 联网搜索的插件。它在 Cordis 插件启动时向 ctx.web 注册 tavily 搜索 provider，并通过 bundle 补丁将 web 的搜索选择切换到 Tavily。搜索时把查询词和结果数发送到 Tavily，返回去重后的标题、链接、摘要和可用的发布日期；也处理服务错误、请求超时与调用方取消。适合希望将 DSH 的网页搜索接到独立搜索服务的用户。需要 Tavily API key，可经凭据服务或启动环境提供；也可配置搜索深度、结果数和超时。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:81-94","src/provider.js:109-185","cordis.patch.yml:16-24"]}
{"unit_id":"my-dsh__dsh-web-search-tavily#card-en","repo":"my-dsh/dsh-web-search-tavily","commit":"4b4ea31a7012c6b51f9ba7c4a9d08c9bc2d1f53f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-web-search-tavily adds Tavily as DSH web search provider. A bundle patch selects it for searches. Queries go to Tavily; results include deduplicated links, titles, and snippets. It handles errors, timeouts, and cancellation. Use a Tavily API key; result count and timeout are configurable.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:81-94","src/provider.js:109-185","cordis.patch.yml:16-24"]}
